WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.350
Dictating doesn't have to cost a cent.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.350
Enter your own server in the settings.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.150
Then your recording stays on your computer.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.740
And with OpenAI, a dictation costs about a tenth of a cent.
